🎯 15. INTERVIEW ANSWER TEMPLATE
==========================================================================================

Q: How does hash indexing work?

Answer:

1. Hash function maps key → bucket
2. Data stored as (key, pointer)
3. O(1) average lookup
4. Collisions handled via chaining
5. Not suitable for range queries
6. WAL ensures durability

🔥 Clean + complete answer

